<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n32506" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκνεύω</span></b> , aor.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξένευσα,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>turn the head out of</i> its
			natural position, of a horse, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ.
			ἄνω</span> to <i>toss</i> the head, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				5.4
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῇ κεφαλῇ ἐκνεύσας</span>
			<i>by a side-movement</i> with the head, of the wild boar, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Cyn.</u>
				10.12
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>4 Ki.</u>
				23.16
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> c. acc.,
				<i>shun, avoid,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Sign.</u>
				27
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.146
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Orph.
				<u>A.</u>
				458
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξίφος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hegesias
				</span></i>
			 ap.<i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				<u>Comp.</u>
				18
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πληγήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					17.100
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>fall headlong,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς θάνατον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Ph.</u>
					1268
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. πρός τι</span>”
				<i>to turn aside,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					1.297
				</span></i>
			 : c. gen., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν παρόντων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plot.
					6.7.34
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>motion away,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξένευσ᾽ ἀποστῆναι πρόσω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>IT</u>
					1330
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
